  "note": "Subject v2.1: the output is yours to design (not strictly checked), so the run checks only look for the subject's markers and that nothing crashes. The structure is checked for real: classes / methods the subject asks for, inheritance, super(), protected attributes, validation in the setters, static / class methods, nested stats class. Source: authorized builtins, no import, type hints, PascalCase / snake_case naming, flake8, mypy.",
  "exercises": [
    {
